[Desktop Entry]
Name=WemeetApp (Vendor X11)
Name[zh_CN]=腾讯会议（官方 X11 启动）
Comment=Vendor launcher that forces XWayland (screen share usually broken on GNOME Wayland)
Comment[zh_CN]=官方启动器（强制 XWayland，GNOME 下屏幕共享通常不可用）
Exec=/usr/bin/wemeetapp %u
TryExec=/usr/bin/wemeetapp
Icon=wemeetapp
Type=Application
Terminal=false
NoDisplay=true
Categories=AudioVideo;Recorder;VideoConference;
